flowchart TB
  VSC["VS Code<br/>software engineers"]
  IJ["IntelliJ IDEA<br/>Java engineers"]
  SM["SageMaker Studio<br/>data scientists, beside the data"]

  CC["<b>Claude Code</b><br/>the same tool, the same policy,<br/>wherever the work already happens"]

  BR["<b>Claude on Amazon Bedrock</b><br/>every surface, every session<br/>inference runs in your own AWS account<br/><i>SageMaker runs the client, not the model</i>"]
  POL["<b>Policy lives in the repository</b><br/>what a session may read, run and change<br/>reviewed like any other change"]

  subgraph GCP["GCP"]
    GCPAPP["Customer-facing web"]
    GCPOBS["Logs · metrics · deploy state"]
  end
  subgraph AWS["AWS"]
    AWSAPP["Payments services"]
    AWSOBS["Application logs · metrics · deploy state"]
    ADOT["ADOT collector<br/>OTLP endpoint"]
    CWCC["<b>CloudWatch — Claude Code usage</b><br/>sessions · tokens · cost · active time<br/>commits · PRs · lines changed<br/>edit-permission decisions"]
    ADOT --> CWCC
  end

  VSC --> CC
  IJ --> CC
  SM --> CC
  POL --> CC
  CC ==>|"every model call"| BR
  CC ==>|"build and deploy"| AWSAPP
  CC ==>|"build and deploy"| GCPAPP
  CC -->|"OpenTelemetry — how the tool itself is measured"| ADOT
  AWSOBS -.->|"read-only — what an SRE investigates with"| CC
  GCPOBS -.->|"read-only"| CC

  classDef hub stroke-width:3px;
  classDef plane stroke-width:2px;
  class CC hub;
  class BR,POL plane;
